==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[fjórir]]'' "[[four]]". Meaning '''twenty and four'''.

===Cardinal numeral===
{{head|is|numeral}} {{g|m-p}}

# '''[[twenty-four]]'''; the cardinal number after [[tuttugu og þrír#Icelandic|tuttugu og þrír]] and before [[tuttugu og fimm#Icelandic|tuttugu og fimm]].

